## Third-party attribution

The layered memory design in this project is derived from dsh-memory-evolve:

    dsh-memory-evolve
    https://github.com/csyangwen/dsh-memory-evolve
    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-external

No source code from that project is included here. What was adopted is the
design concept (five-track layering, injection at session start, two-step
confirmation for key memory, archiving rather than deletion). The
implementation in this repository is independent. See docs/ATTRIBUTION.md.

The MIT License above applies to this project's own code. The upstream
project's MIT License continues to apply to its own code.
